OL,3,GNEWSAGiant machine tears down city
OL,4,Acentre office block
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 1970s city centre office block is
OL,7,Fbeing torn down by a huge demolition
OL,8,Fmachine as a major project to build
OL,9,F1,100 homes enters a new phase.
OL,11,FGildengate House and Sovereign House
OL,12,Fare the only prominent buildings still
OL,13,Fstanding at Norwich's Anglia Square,
OL,14,Fbut now work has begun to raze them
OL,15,Fboth to the ground.
OL,17,FOn Tuesday, a piece of engineering
OL,18,Fequipment described as one of the
OL,19,Ftallest in the country began taking
OL,20,Fchunks out of Gildengate House as
OL,21,Fonlookers gathered to witness the
OL,22,Fdestruction.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
