OL,3,GNEWSAGiant machine tears down city
OL,4,Acentre office block
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucy Galvin, the Green leader of
OL,7,FNorwich City Council, gave reassurances
OL,8,Fthe work would be done "very carefully"
OL,9,Fafter the collapse of other buildings
OL,10,Fat the site caused large dust clouds.
